# Copied to .dev.vars by `pnpm dev`. The Worker's secrets for local runs; never commit .dev.vars.
BETTER_AUTH_SECRET=local-development-only-secret-0123456789abcdef
# Optional: where the daily feedback mail goes; without it feedback is kept and nothing is mailed. Printed to the console locally.
# FEEDBACK_EMAIL=you@example.com
# Optional: lets the review app read feedback (GET /v1/admin/feedback); at least 32 characters, the same value as the
# review app's FEEDBACK_READ_TOKEN. Without it the route does not exist.
# FEEDBACK_READ_TOKEN=local-development-only-feedback-token-0123456789
# Optional: reminders. `pnpm --filter @wordado/server vapid-keys` prints a pair.
# VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=
# VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY=
# VAPID_SUBJECT=mailto:you@example.com
